{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"predictive policing feedback loop predictive policing feedback loop","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md","fileName":"Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Predictive Policing Feedback Loop","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Algorithmic Fairness and Justice]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algorithmic Fairness and Justice","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"predictive policing feedback loop predictive policing feedback loop","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md","fileName":"Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Predictive Policing Feedback Loop","heading":"Predictive Policing Feedback Loop","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A predictive policing feedback loop occurs when recorded police activity is used to direct future enforcement, causing more activity to be recorded in the same places and then treated as evidence of greater underlying crime. The model learns partly from the institution's earlier attention rather than from a neutral measure of all offending.\n\nThis loop can intensify unequal surveillance even if the algorithm applies its rule consistently. More deployment creates more data, and more data appear to validate the deployment. Breaking the loop requires distinguishing reported or discovered incidents from actual prevalence and evaluating the social costs of concentrated enforcement.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algorithmic Fairness and Justice","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"predictive policing feedback loop predictive policing feedback loop","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md","fileName":"Predictive Policing Feedback Loop.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Predictive Policing Feedback Loop","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algorithmic Fairness and Justice","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}